    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/4a7d4d02d40eadde9768d43afcddeb78.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>No one here gets a clean ending. Six broken souls crawl back from death, betrayal, and ruin \u2014 each with their own reason to strike back. Whether it\u2019s for revenge, justice, redemption, or something darker... everyone has blood to answer for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/4601ee2e5b8c588d4f1adbf7b43f3139.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/4601ee2e5b8c588d4f1adbf7b43f3139.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/a0cf0f6cffd73e513108ec20ac035ac4.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>Combat is turn-based \u2014 tactical, brutal, and full of surprises. Destroy enemies in one turn with the right tools, or get overwhelmed by impossible odds. Every decision matters. Every misstep bleeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/01a4855b050454cc3b3460250e78e996.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/01a4855b050454cc3b3460250e78e996.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/0253055159f114d580a297fa68f2700b.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain perks, find relics, break systems, defy death... but know that power always twists something in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/873878adb086206ea91cf3cd8e8fc0fb.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/873878adb086206ea91cf3cd8e8fc0fb.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/5c6e48d1740541db9385a3a0422c7608.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>Each ring is an opportunity \u2014 or a trap. Choose your destinations carefully as you navigate dangerous encounters, mysterious shops, and risky events. Your path through the city is yours to forge, but beware: every choice changes the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/80c1decb1a324b69efd14d78d53513a1.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/80c1decb1a324b69efd14d78d53513a1.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/fcbd3f6c63684230ae4f7eeef31addb7.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>This city doesn\u2019t forgive. It punishes. From shadowed alleys to neon-lit backrooms, danger lurks in every corner. The criminals, the corrupt, and the supernatural all want a piece of you \u2014 and they won\u2019t stop until you\u2019re gone. Survive long enough, and maybe you\u2019ll make your own mark\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/ec0c5441072389891f1556e7640d82d1.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/ec0c5441072389891f1556e7640d82d1.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six playable characters with unique skills and storylines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events, choices, and routes that change with every run   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 relics and items to find, stack, and break the game with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops, healers, and chests \u2014 every stop is a gamble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty art, voice lines, and an original music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/4a7d4d02d40eadde9768d43afcddeb78.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>No one here gets a clean ending. Six broken souls crawl back from death, betrayal, and ruin \u2014 each with their own reason to strike back. Whether it\u2019s for revenge, justice, redemption, or something darker... everyone has blood to answer for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/4601ee2e5b8c588d4f1adbf7b43f3139.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/4601ee2e5b8c588d4f1adbf7b43f3139.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/a0cf0f6cffd73e513108ec20ac035ac4.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>Combat is turn-based \u2014 tactical, brutal, and full of surprises. Destroy enemies in one turn with the right tools, or get overwhelmed by impossible odds. Every decision matters. Every misstep bleeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/01a4855b050454cc3b3460250e78e996.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/01a4855b050454cc3b3460250e78e996.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/0253055159f114d580a297fa68f2700b.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain perks, find relics, break systems, defy death... but know that power always twists something in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/873878adb086206ea91cf3cd8e8fc0fb.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/873878adb086206ea91cf3cd8e8fc0fb.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/5c6e48d1740541db9385a3a0422c7608.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>Each ring is an opportunity \u2014 or a trap. Choose your destinations carefully as you navigate dangerous encounters, mysterious shops, and risky events. Your path through the city is yours to forge, but beware: every choice changes the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/80c1decb1a324b69efd14d78d53513a1.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/80c1decb1a324b69efd14d78d53513a1.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/fcbd3f6c63684230ae4f7eeef31addb7.avif?t=1750291685\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span>This city doesn\u2019t forgive. It punishes. From shadowed alleys to neon-lit backrooms, danger lurks in every corner. The criminals, the corrupt, and the supernatural all want a piece of you \u2014 and they won\u2019t stop until you\u2019re gone. Survive long enough, and maybe you\u2019ll make your own mark\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/ec0c5441072389891f1556e7640d82d1.poster.avif?t=1750291685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490210/extras/ec0c5441072389891f1556e7640d82d1.webm?t=1750291685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six playable characters with unique skills and storylines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events, choices, and routes that change with every run   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 relics and items to find, stack, and break the game with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops, healers, and chests \u2014 every stop is a gamble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty art, voice lines, and an original music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Fight, loot, and manipulate your way through the criminal underworld in this brutal, turn-based RPG strategy roguelike. Choose from 6 unique characters, face merciless enemies, loot powerful relics, and encounter random events that let strategy and persuasion shape your quest for revenge.",
